# Curse of Opulence, an Aura that enchants a player (CR 303.4): "Whenever enchanted player is attacked, create a Gold
# token. Each opponent attacking that player does the same." Bot1 enchants itself on turn 1; on turn 4 Bot2 attacks it with
# Ornithopter, and both players get a Gold token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Curse of Opulence
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Curse of Opulence.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Curse of Opulence; Gold Token; Mountain
Bot2.Battlefield = Gold Token; Ornithopter
